# Code owners for ITS-HCD/nysds-site
#
# GitHub requests a review from the owners of the files a pull request
# changes. It sends the request when the pull request opens, or when a draft
# is marked ready for review. Draft pull requests don't trigger requests.
#
# Code owner approval isn't required to merge. To make it a merge gate, turn on
# "Require review from Code Owners" in the branch protection for main.
#
# Ownership comes from line-weighted commit history (release and version-bump
# commits excluded) and team meeting notes, as of November 2026. The first
# owner on a line is the primary owner and the second is the backup. GitHub
# requests both, skips whoever opened the pull request, and counts either
# approval as a code owner review.
#
# The last matching pattern wins, so keep specific paths after general ones.
# To check this file, open it on GitHub. GitHub flags any invalid lines.

# Default owner for anything not listed later in this file
